<h1 align="center">The Pentatorah-Zerostore</h1>
<h4 align="center">A.K.A.</h4>
<h2 align="center">The Lesser-Than-Little Key of Confusus</h2>

<div style="font-size: .80em"><p>Wherein the subtle Eristic Principles at work in the world are revealed, 
and their subtle relationships are exposed, and their influence on the world can 
be discerned and one is left as perplexed as one was when one started.</p></div>

<hr>
<h3>What It Is</h3>
The Principia Discordia, as a divinely revealed document, contains coded within it, subtle relationships in contex.<br>
A set of Holy Words and Phrases exist within the text. Numeric values of these words can be calculated 
using the Lesser Key. These numeric values, in turn, represent the army of Discordian Principles at work in the world.<br>
The Pentatorah is the set of words.<br>
The Zerostore is the set of numeric values.<br>
The Lesser-Than-Little Key of Confusus is the letter to number translation algorithm.<br>
The QBoolaBoola is a collection of public contributions and discoveries concerning the PeZ.<br>


<h3>How It Works</h3>

<div style="font-size: .80em"><em>"The Word is a virus."</em>-William S. Burroughs</div><br>

The principles at work in the Principia Discordia are the same Discordian Forces manifest in the world, and
those forces signatures in the world can be seen through the lense of the Pentorah.<br>

<ol>
There are 5 grades of words, cossesponding to the five Days in the Discorian calender.
<li>SweetMorn. A word who's value is less than 35, A Cabbage.</li>
<li>Boomtime. A word whose value is between two manifest holy numbers.</li>
<li>Pungenday. A word who's value is equal to a manifest holy number.</li>
<li>Prickle-Prickle. A word who's value is equal to more than one manifest holy number.</li>
<li>Setting Orange. A word who's value is greater than 2624, Illuminate the Opposition.</li>
</ol>

A Sweetmorn word is merely a componant of a larger word or phrase under the influence of an Eristic Principle.<br>
A Boomtime word has associated with it the Eristic Principles signified by the values just above and below it.<br>
A Pungenday word is an agent directly under control of the Eristic Principle represented by that word's value.<br>
A Prickle-Prickle word is an agent of a group of Eristic Principles that have formed a bond and work as a collective.<br>
A Setting Orange word is under the influence of more than one Eristic Principle that are not consistantly working as a united front.<br>



<h3>Example:</h3>
If I calculate the value of "Jenna Bush" I find that it is 690. It is a Boomtime word. Jenna Bush
is being influenced by the principles of "Pineal Gland" and "the Moon".<br>
If I calculate the value of "television" I find it's value is 1188. It is a Pungenday word. Television is under 
the influence of "Sweetmorn", so television is merely a componant of a whole force at work.<br>
And so it goes.<br>

<p>
The holy words of the Pentatorah were revealed to me as I scanned through the P.D. I simply noted 
them and then translated them later. (Actually I did it as I found them, but I had no concern
for their values as I went) Only when I was finished did I realize that the list of words filled
exactly 5 pages on my Word document under it's default settings.</p>

<div style="font-size: .85em; text-align:right;"><em>"I find the Law of Fives to be more and more manifest the harder I look."</em>-Omar Ravenhurst</div><br>

<p>This only scratches at the surface of this system, there exist within it increasingly complex and 
subtle patterns and relationships that must be found by the student. I was too lazy.<br>

</p><hr>
